{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-12-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'BOFA PROVIDES NEARLY $19 MILLION TO LOCAL HUNGER ORGANIZATIONS FROM EMPLOYEE BOOSTER CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'MORE THAN $150M DISTRIBUTED TO HELP FIGHT FOOD INSECURITY SINCE 2015 NEW YORK , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BANK OF AMERICA ANNOUNCED TODAY IT WILL DONATE AN ADDITIONAL $8 MILLION TO LOCAL HUNGER ORGANIZATIONS FROM ITS SECOND EMPLOYEE BOOSTER CAMPAIGN.\xa0 AS A RESULT, NEARLY $19 MILLION WILL BE DISTRIBUTED TO HUNGER RELIEF ORGANIZATIONS IN LOCAL COMMUNITIES ACROSS THE U.S. AND PUERTO RICO.'}